<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<!--
    Full-org retrieve manifest (sample). Most types use "*"; the exceptions are commented where they appear.

    Retrieve:   sf project retrieve start -x manifest/package-full-org.xml -o <alias> -w 60
    Exact list: "sf project generate manifest" with the from-org flag builds a package.xml that names every
                component in the org, including reports and standard objects.

    Notes:
    - A full retrieve is large. If it times out, raise -w (minutes) or retrieve one section at a time.
    - Types the org does not use, or that its API version does not know, return a warning, not a failure.
    - Retrieve only; do not deploy this file as-is (Settings, Profiles and Certificates affect the whole org).
-->
